{
  "info": {
    "name": "Circa API Socios v1 — SOLO TEST (ZOOM)",
    "description": "## Circa × ZOOM — solo ambiente de pruebas\n\n**No incluye producción.**\n\n| Campo | Valor |\n|-------|--------|\n| Base | `https://circa-production-c517.up.railway.app/api/v1/test` |\n| client_id | `zoom-circa` |\n| Auth | `https://circa-production-c517.up.railway.app/api/v1/auth/token` |\n\n### Pasos\n1. Auth → Obtener token — pruebas\n2. SVC-01 → mirar `situacion`\n3. `no_registrada` → SVC-02 (fotos)\n4. `con_linea` → SVC-04 (monto + plazo)\n\nSwagger: https://circa-production-c517.up.railway.app/api/v1/docs\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://circa-production-c517.up.railway.app/api/v1/test"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "value": "zoom-circa"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_secret",
      "value": "VDgiZdWPaEhqghHiyurUQZyQT2wqWYfSz5KTkyfLsWA"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "woeVXt0ZdO4Dx9m4OuwC2oFYzLMgQzdD"
    },
    {
      "key": "bodega_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "pedido_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "q_dni_inexistente",
      "value": "00000000"
    },
    {
      "key": "q_dni_inactiva",
      "value": "08608042"
    },
    {
      "key": "q_dni_activa_con_cupo",
      "value": "46843088"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Auth (test)",
      "description": "Solo data_mode=test. Credenciales ZOOM de prueba precargadas.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Obtener token — pruebas (data_mode=test)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('token test', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.data_mode).to.eql('test');",
                  "  pm.expect(j.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "if (j.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{client_id}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{client_secret}}\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"test\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token",
            "description": "Igual que prod pero `data_mode: \"test\"` → token para `/api/v1/test/...`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — token test",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"access_token\": \"<api_token_test>\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"test\",\n  \"expires_in\": null,\n  \"distribuidor_id\": \"d1a2b3c4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002\",\n  \"distribuidor\": \"ZOOM CORP\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Servicios de prueba",
      "description": "Todos los requests usan {{baseUrl}} = /api/v1/test.\nBearer: {{access_token}}.\nFlujo: SVC-01 situacion → SVC-02 fotos → SVC-04 monto/plazo.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
          {
            "key": "token",
            "value": "{{access_token}}",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health (test)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('data_mode test', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().data_mode).to.eql('test'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK test",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"service\": \"circa-integration-api\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"data_mode\": \"test\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Bodegas (test)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "SVC-02 Precargar (+ fotos) test",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                      "  var d = pm.response.json();",
                      "  if (d.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('bodega_id', d.id);",
                      "  pm.test('es_test y fotos', function () {",
                      "    pm.expect(d.es_test).to.eql(true);",
                      "    pm.expect(d.tiene_foto_dueno).to.eql(true);",
                      "    pm.expect(d.tiene_foto_bodega).to.eql(true);",
                      "    pm.expect(d.situacion).to.eql('en_evaluacion');",
                      "  });",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "formdata",
                  "formdata": [
                    {
                      "key": "telefono_whatsapp",
                      "value": "999000001",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "dni_representante",
                      "value": "00000001",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "razon_social",
                      "value": "BODEGA TEST API",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "nombre_comercial",
                      "value": "Bodega Test",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "distrito",
                      "value": "Miraflores",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "solo_dni_sin_ruc",
                      "value": "true",
                      "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "foto_dueno",
                      "type": "file",
                      "src": [],
                      "description": "Seleccionar archivo"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "foto_bodega",
                      "type": "file",
                      "src": [],
                      "description": "Seleccionar archivo"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas",
                "description": "Igual que prod pero en `/api/v1/test`. Respuesta con `es_test: true`."
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "200 — creada test",
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "header": [
                    {
                      "key": "Content-Type",
                      "value": "application/json"
                    }
                  ],
                  "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"t1e2s3t4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001\",\n  \"telefono_whatsapp\": \"+51999000001\",\n  \"dni_representante\": \"00000001\",\n  \"razon_social\": \"BODEGA TEST API\",\n  \"estado\": \"inactivo\",\n  \"situacion\": \"en_evaluacion\",\n  \"tiene_foto_dueno\": true,\n  \"tiene_foto_bodega\": true,\n  \"es_test\": true,\n  \"created\": true,\n  \"linea_disponible\": 0.0\n}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "SVC-01 Listar / buscar",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas?q=00000001&limit=20",
                "description": "Buscar en modo test. Ver ejemplos de `situacion` en carpeta Producción."
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "200 — ejemplo",
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "header": [
                    {
                      "key": "Content-Type",
                      "value": "application/json"
                    }
                  ],
                  "body": "{\n  \"total\": 1,\n  \"situacion\": \"en_evaluacion\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"t1e2s3t4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001\",\n      \"situacion\": \"en_evaluacion\",\n      \"es_test\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "SVC-01b Obtener bodega",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas/{{bodega_id}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "SVC-03 Patch bodega",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"nombre_comercial\": \"Bodega Test Actualizada\",\n  \"distrito\": \"Miraflores\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas/{{bodega_id}}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Preventas / Pedidos (test)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "SVC-04 Crear preventa",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                      "  var d = pm.response.json();",
                      "  if (d.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('pedido_id', d.id);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"external_id\": \"TEST-PV-001\",\n  \"bodega_id\": \"{{bodega_id}}\",\n  \"vendedor_codigo\": \"TEST01\",\n  \"monto_a_financiar\": 10.0,\n  \"plazo_dias\": 15,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"sku\": \"T0001\",\n      \"nombre\": \"Producto test\",\n      \"cantidad\": 1,\n      \"precio_unitario\": 10\n    }\n  ]\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/preventas"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "SVC-05 Obtener preventa",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/preventas/{{pedido_id}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "SVC-07 Cambiar estado",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"estado\": \"preventa_aceptada\",\n  \"comentario\": \"Aceptada en modo test\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/pedidos/{{pedido_id}}/estado"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "SVC-01 Casos (test)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "TP-01 No encuentra → no_registrada",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                      "const j = pm.response.json();",
                      "pm.test('situacion', function () { pm.expect(j.situacion).to.eql('no_registrada'); });"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas?q={{q_dni_inexistente}}&limit=20"
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "Ejemplo",
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "header": [
                    {
                      "key": "Content-Type",
                      "value": "application/json"
                    }
                  ],
                  "body": "{\n  \"total\": 0,\n  \"items\": [],\n  \"situacion\": \"no_registrada\"\n}"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "TP-07 Token prod en URL test → 403",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "pm.test('HTTP 403 si se usó token prod', function () {",
                      "  pm.expect([401,403]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                      "});"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": {
                  "type": "bearer",
                  "bearer": [
                    {
                      "key": "token",
                      "value": "{{access_token_prod}}",
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/bodegas?limit=5",
                "description": "Token de producción no debe funcionar en `/test`."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}